        {
          "text": "Lino makani aya naakamana, bapati bakasika kulindime, bati, Bantu ba-Israyeli abapaizi aba-Levi tabana kulipambukanya abantu bamasi. Balacita mbubonya mbuli zisesemyo zyabo, ba-Kanana, ba-Hiti, ba-Perizi, ba-Jebusi, ba-Amoni, ba-Moabu, ba-Egepita, aba-Amori, ",
