                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kwakabungana kulindime boonse ibakali kuyoowa majwi aa-Leza wa-Israyeli, nkaambo kakubisya kwabaabo ibakazwide mubuzike, nkabela ndakakala cakugamba mane kusikila kuciindi cacipaizyo camangolezya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
