                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo tuli bazike, pele Leza wesu tana kutusoowa mubuzike bwesu. Wacita kuti tufwidwe luzyalo mumeso aabami ba-Persia, kuti atuponononye, tubusye iŋanda ya-Leza wesu akuyakulula matongo aayo, kuti tukale kabotu mucisi ca-Juda amuJerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino twaambe buti, O Leza wesu, kusule lyayaaya? Nkaambo twasoowa milazyo yako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njowakalailila kumilomo yabalanda bako basinsimi. Wakati, Nyika njemuyoovuba ninyika iisofweede; yasofwaazigwa busofwi bwabantu bamasi azisesemyo zyabo, nkaambo baizuzya busofwi bwabo kuzwa kumagolelo kusikila kumagolelo aayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
